# Changelog

## Version 1.0 – 2026-08-11
- Created six HTML5 pages.
- Added semantic header, nav, main, section, article and footer elements.
- Added a consistent navigation menu across all pages.
- Added responsive CSS styling.
- Added detailed business, service and target-audience content.
- Added enquiry form with labels and validation attributes.
- Added README documentation.
- Added this development changelog.

## Recommended next development
- Connect the enquiry form to a secure back-end/email service.
- Add approved business contact details.
- Add real destination photographs and image alternative text.
- Test all links and form behaviour before final submission.
# Development Changelog

## [Version 2.0.0] - 2026-09-18 (Part 2 Implementation)
### Added
- Created external master stylesheet `css/style.css`.
- Implemented CSS Custom Properties (`:root`) for centralized color palettes, fonts, shadows, and spacing.
- Added comprehensive CSS Reset (`*, *::before, *::after`) to standardize rendering across Chrome, Safari, Firefox, and Edge.
- Built responsive CSS Grid (`auto-fit`, `minmax()`) layout for service cards, safari packages, and travel articles.
- Added interactive states using pseudo-classes (`:hover`, `:focus`, `:active`, `:nth-child()`, `::selection`, `::placeholder`).
- Implemented multi-tier media queries for Tablet (`1024px`), Mobile (`768px`), and Small Screen Mobile (`480px`).
- Formatted form inputs with focus rings, hover responses, and accessible fieldset legends.

### Changed
- Linked `css/style.css` across all 7 website HTML files (`index.html`, `aboutus.html`, `contact.html`, `enquiry.html`, `events.html`, `menu.html`, `service.html`).
- Replaced legacy `<hr>` structural breaks with clean CSS margin/border spacing.
- Enhanced navigation links into modern responsive button-style menu items.

---

## [Version 1.0.0] - 2026-08-11 (Part 1 Initial Submission)
### Added
- Created core HTML5 web pages (`index.html`, `aboutus.html`, `contact.html`, `enquiry.html`, `events.html`, `menu.html`, `service.html`).
- Implemented semantic tags (`<header>`, `<nav>`, `<main>`, `<section>`, `<article>`, `<figure>`, `<figcaption>`, `<footer>`).
- Added structured booking enquiry form with validation attributes (`required`, `type="email"`, `type="tel"`).
